<section class="ref-group"><h2>Battles <span class="n">24</span></h2><ul class="enc-list"><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-salamis-in-cyprus"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Salamis in Cyprus</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 497 BCE</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Salamis in Cyprus was fought in 497 BCE during the Ionian Revolt, when the Greek cities of Cyprus, led by Onesilus of Salamis, rose against Persian rule.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-lake-regillus"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/battle-of-lake-regillus.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Lake Regillus</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · c. 496 BCE</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Lake Regillus was a legendary victory of the early Roman Republic over the Latin League, traditionally dated around 496 BCE, near Tusculum in the Alban…</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-lade"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/battle-of-lade.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Lade</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 494 BCE</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Lade was a naval battle fought in 494 BCE off the island of Lade near Miletus.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-sepeia"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Sepeia</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · c. 494 BCE</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Sepeia was fought around 494 BCE near Tiryns in the Argolid between Sparta, led by King Cleomenes I, and Argos.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-marathon"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/battle-of-marathon.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Marathon</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 490 BC